--- !u!114 &211335780372273309
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6981012853175297034}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d7cd308d1b5fefe4e9cbd80ca7f63f8f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialPanel
  tutorialPanel: {fileID: 6981012853175297034}
  tutorialTitleText: {fileID: 6639767150815312655}
  tutorialTitle: {fileID: 7442207627629788266}
  tutorialDescription: {fileID: 995116701949220049}
  tutorialImage: {fileID: 6312330674490816741}
  leftButton: {fileID: 810905123600896268}
  rightButton: {fileID: 1626507368711325485}
  skipButton: {fileID: 0}
  startButton: {fileID: 0}
  replayPracticeButton: {fileID: 7200765599701427629}
  titles:
  - THE AREA
  - THE GO-BAG
  - FINDING ITEMS
  - ITEM DRAGGING
  - WEIGHT METER
  - GAME TIMER
  - JOURNAL
  - FINISHING THE PUZZLE
  - THE QUIZ
  - THE MINIGAME
  descriptions:
  - "This is the house you\u2019ll explore. Each room may contain items you\u2019ll
    need for your <nobr>go-bag</nobr>. Look carefully\u2014some items are in the
    kitchen, bathroom, or bedroom."
  - Find and secure your Go-Bag! Both your starting position and the <color=#FF8B43>bag
    spawn randomly each round</color>, so explore the rooms quickly to locate it
    before packing your emergency supplies.
  - '<color=#FF8B43>Items</color> are placed in realistic locations. For example,

    water
    is often in the kitchen. Hold an item to see its name and description.'
  - To pack an item, <color=#FF8B43>drag it from the storage</color> to your <nobr>go-bag</nobr>.
    The item will move into your bag, and the weight meter will update.
  - "Your <nobr>go-bag</nobr> can only carry a <color=#FF4343>limited weight</color>.
    The meter shows how much weight you\u2019ve packed. If you exceed the limit,
    you must remove an item before you can submit."
  - You have limited time to pack. The <color=#FF4343>timer counts down</color> during
    the whole puzzle.
  - Catalogs essential emergency gear and tracks unlocked items. <color=#FF4343>Items
    start locked</color> in the codex and <color=#96B000>unlock automatically</color>
    upon being collected during exploration.
  - "When you think you\u2019ve packed everything you need, approach the door. The
    game will ask \u2018Are you finished?\u2019 If you say yes, you\u2019ll move
    on to the quiz. If you say no, you can keep playing."
  - "After you finish packing, you\u2019ll answer a scenario based questions. <color=#FF8B43>Drag
    the correct item</color> into the answer box. This helps you remember why each
    item matters."
  - "Now it\u2019s time to put your readiness to the test in a fast-paced challenge!
    Follow the on-screen instructions, use what you\u2019ve learned, and complete
    the objective before <color=#FF4343>time runs out</color>."
  images:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 384e861d1e532984f86d23789723cec4, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: edefb667b75da494eb16c0bcb07bcf46, type: 3}
